//
// One TU per (profile, variant) tuple. Each instantiates the heavy
// do_tile<...> kernel for exactly one variant geometry, across the
// 2 precisions x 3 row/col modes = 6 do_tile bodies per file. One TU
// per variant lets make/ninja dispatch the per-(profile, variant) files
